Value Filldown,Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Filldown,Required DIRECTION (Inbound|Outbound)
Value ADDRESS_FAMILY (IPv4|IPv6|MAC)
Value ACL_NAME (\S+)
Value STATUS ([^)]+)
Value DEFAULT_ACTION (Permit|Deny)

# "display packet-filter interface": for each interface and direction, the ACL applied
# per address family ("IPv4 ACL 3998", with "(Failed)" when it is not in effect) and the
# action for packets no rule matches ("IPv4 default action: Permit"), one row each.
Start
  ^Interface:\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$
  ^\s+${DIRECTION}\s+policy:\s*$$
  ^\s+${ADDRESS_FAMILY}\s+ACL\s+${ACL_NAME}(?:\s+\(${STATUS}\))?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s+${ADDRESS_FAMILY}\s+default\s+action:\s+${DEFAULT_ACTION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.* -> Error "unrecognized display packet-filter interface line"
